Patch: 005-fake-app-server-script
Reason: the stand-in app-server could only echo; FAKE_CODEX_SCRIPT scripts each turn and `twice` delivers one call twice, so the duplicate-delivery path is tested
Upstream: ours
Pins: a DSL agent node runs on Codex: the host tool, then submit, through the proxy to the provider
Pins: the same call delivered twice runs its tool once, and both deliveries are answered with the one result
---
